e":"汤四子：长子平；平弟成，左中郎将：并早卒。","attribution":"华峤《汉书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c01fb7f7704df4169afc","start":86,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-p055a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-1d534a85e282d6495123","layer":"pei","quote":"《英雄记》曰：“成字文开。壮健有部分。贵戚权豪，自大将军梁冀以下，皆与结好，言无不从。故京师为作谚曰：‘事不谐，问文开。’”","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c01fb7f7704df4169afc","start":0,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-f0028-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-1d534a85e282d6495123","layer":"pei","quote":"成字文开","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c01fb7f7704df4169afc","start":8,"end":12,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p053","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-9e9f888b25d6ea1dc29c","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞华峤《汉书》曰：“安字邵公。好学有威重。明帝时为楚郡太守，治楚王狱。所申理者四百余家，皆蒙全济，安遂为名臣。章帝时至司徒，生蜀郡太守京。京弟敞，为司空。京子汤，太尉。汤四子：长子平；平弟成，左中郎将：并早卒。成弟逢，逢弟隗：皆为公。”","attribution":"华峤《汉书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c01fb7f7704df4169afc","start":0,"end":120,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p054","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-4721c54c5b6ec0b6f42b","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏书》曰：“自安以下，皆博爱容众，无所拣择。宾客入其门，无贤愚皆得所欲，为天下所归。绍即逢之庶子，术异母兄也；出后成，为子。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c01fb7f7704df4169afc","start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p055","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-1d534a85e282d6495123","layer":"pei","quote":"《英雄记》曰：“成字文开。壮健有部分。贵戚权豪，自大将军梁冀以下，皆与结好，言无不从。故京师为作谚曰：‘事不谐，问文开。’”","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c01fb7f7704df4169afc","start":0,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p056","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-820911e33630e6596e34","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《英雄记》曰：“绍生而父死，二公爱之。幼使为郎，弱冠除濮阳长，有清名。遭母丧；服竟，又追行父服：凡在冢庐六年。礼毕，隐居洛阳，不妄通宾客；非海内知名，不得相见。又好游侠，与张孟卓、何伯求、吴子卿、许子远、伍德瑜等，皆为奔走之友。不应辟命。中常侍赵忠谓诸黄门曰：‘袁本初坐作声价，不应呼召而养死士；不知此儿欲何所为乎！’绍叔父隗闻之，责数绍曰：‘汝且破我家！’绍于是乃起，应大将军之命。”","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bf0d3b8b250635b85059","start":0,"end":196,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p057","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-b177a81f69d16840f994","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：《魏书》云“绍，逢之庶子，出后伯父成”。如此《记》所言，则似实成所生。夫人追服所生，礼无其文；况于所后，而可以行之？二书未详孰是。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bf0d3b8b250635b85059","start":0,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
